Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.90,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Good morning, Master Henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:52.08,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Good morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.27,0:00:54.78,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Would you like some tea, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:56.82,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd love some.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:05.08,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,It's been a while since you were in \Ncharge of the grade school kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:06.92,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,How are the kids this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:09.84,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I must say, they show promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:15.50,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,I heard you had to give one of them \Na Tonitrus Bolt on their first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:22.38,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,True, it was a rather rare occurrence \Nfor our prestigious Eden College.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:25.77,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,It's the first time I've heard \Nof it happening, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:29.61,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I only did what was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:31.61,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Good deeds shall be praised,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:34.94,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,and misconduct will be met with punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:37.91,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That is essential to education.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:39.78,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,I have much to learn from you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:47.21,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,As the elementary students pass \Nthrough the gates of Eden College
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:52.80,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,to learn true elegance every day,\N our school's traditions shall live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:58.01,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Our house of learning exists to ensure \Nthe future of our country is elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.44,0:02:19.03,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:23.12,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Isn't this your older brother, Lord Damian?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:25.74,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.88,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,This must be his entrance ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:30.46,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,He's probably elsewhere in this book, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.63,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:33.62,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:35.84,main,Emile,0,0,0,,There he is again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:39.43,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,And here! He's truly an MVP!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:45.14,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Your brother is just raking in \Nthe Stellas! How magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:49.98,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,But I'm sure you'll become an Imperial \NScholar even faster, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:54.23,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,We all know you'll be the first \Nto get a Stella in our grade!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:55.87,main,Damian,0,0,0,,W-Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:59.11,main,Emile,0,0,0,,But we still have a while until our exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.45,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Your first opportunity will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:04.32,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Our P.E. class next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:07.29,main,Emile,0,0,0,,We'll be having a dodgeball tournament \Nwith the other classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:12.50,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,My friend told me something he \Nheard from his friend in Class 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:16.13,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,He said if you become MVP, \Nyou can get a Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.13,0:03:17.25,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:19.59,main,Emile,0,0,0,,This is your chance, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.59,0:03:21.43,main,Damian,0,0,0,,MVP, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:47.66,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,It is a clear, sunny day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:49.45,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Young ladies and gentlemen of Eden,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:54.28,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,you will be adding another page \Nto Eden's history today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:04:00.30,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Elegantly and brilliantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:05.22,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up! You picked a fight with me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:06.55,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.18,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Exactly! First off, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:09.47,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut up, uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:10.27,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:10.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shithead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.93,0:04:12.68,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut it, Stubby Legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:15.48,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to talk to girls like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:19.61,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Ele...gant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:52.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:54.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:57.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, I have acquired important news!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:01.63,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You may be able to get a Stella \Nat your next P.E. class?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:03.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,That's what Becky said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:08.26,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,My friend told me something she \Nheard from her friend in Class 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:12.10,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,The MVP from the winning \Nclass in next week's tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.56,flashback,Becky,0,0,0,,will receive a Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:18.77,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,So it's a rumor? That seems dubious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:21.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Then we need to train, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Training!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So what sport will you be playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:26.57,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Dodgeball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Dodgeball...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:32.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That's the game where you hit your opponent \Nwith a ball to do them in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.20,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,"Do them in"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:36.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama! Teach me a killer move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:41.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Very well! I shall teach you the \Nultimate killer move with a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:45.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you also athletic, Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:47.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.17,0:06:50.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I just used to play catch \Nwith my brother sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.55,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't tell them I rip people apart \Nand toss them around on a daily basis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:56.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Just leave this to me, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:58.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll show you a killer move that \Nwill help you catch that star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I will reach for the stars in dodgeball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:05.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya will catch the star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.94,top,Yor,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:08.19,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm glad she's so motivated... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:09.07,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Super Anya will catch the star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:09.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We'll start with strength training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.04,main,Yor,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:23.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:28.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.51,main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(167,1)\pos(320,290)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\fs28\c&H1C08B6&\4a&HCC&}Death-Defying Sit-ups
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.47,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:39.27,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Stamina is crucial, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Now, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:59.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You're not just using your \Narms when you throw the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:02.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You need to make sure you \Nstep out with your foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.41,0:08:05.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,twist your hips as you shift your weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:08.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,channel all of your strength \Ninto your shoulder, and... throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:19.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Okay! Now you give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:21.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:33.99,main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1500)\pos(320,287)\bord2\shad0\fnArial\b1}Visualizing the Game
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:29.07,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,This is training?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:34.01,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't really understand how, \Nbut I did decide to let Yor handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:39.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya, please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:41.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:42.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:43.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:44.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:45.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:46.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:47.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:48.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Slap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:49.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Fwap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.42,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Fwap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Chwass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.05,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Chwass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:11.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna catch that star tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:22.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I did my best. I survived \NMama's ruthless training.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:26.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I even thought up a name for my killer shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna seize that star!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.09,0:09:38.39,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get lots of stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.85,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,so I can help Papa with his mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:45.86,main,Emile,0,0,0,,At least it's clear that you're motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:49.48,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Just make sure you don't hold \NLord Damian back, Stubby Legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:51.61,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Second son... and his lackeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:53.94,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Why are we playing together with the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.90,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Being on the same team \Nwith him is the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.91,0:10:01.66,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Second son... The son of Papa's \Ntarget for this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:04.12,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Good things happen if \NI become friends with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.91,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you staring at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:09.29,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,But he gets really mean, \Nso I don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:15.88,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Well, I don't have any time to \Nwaste on a runt like you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.04,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,A runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:21.39,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm going to get MVP in this tournament \Nand be rewarded a Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:24.85,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I need to become an Imperial \NScholar just like my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:26.56,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:31.61,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Father will never notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:35.36,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.11,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Gather round!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:46.90,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Your usual P.E. teacher, Bobby, \Nis out sick, so I will be his substitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.55,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Do not forget to be proper \Nyoung men and ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:52.58,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,and execute the most elegant of plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:53.16,main,Students,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:58.92,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,We will now begin the dodgeball tournament \Nbetween Class 3, Cecile Hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:00.97,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,and Class 4, Wald Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:02.72,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You may now begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:09.98,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(292,1)\an3\c&H1C00CC&\fscx106\bord0\pos(501,240)}THE GREAT DODGEBALL PLAN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:17.99,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Let's show them who's boss, Lord Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:21.11,main,Class 3 mob,0,0,0,,You've got this, Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:26.99,flashback,Emile,0,0,0,,Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.99,0:11:29.87,flashback,Ewen,0,0,0,,We gathered some intel on Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.00,flashback,Damian,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:37.63,flashback italics,Damian,0,0,0,,In order to be awarded a Stella, \Nyou have to become the MVP.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:38.76,flashback italics,Damian,0,0,0,,My enemy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:40.34,flashback italics,Damian,0,0,0,,is him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.85,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,In order to defeat Class 4 \Nand win this match, first...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:47.85,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,we need to defeat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:57.69,italicstop,Damian,0,0,0,,The son of a command major, Bill Watkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.40,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(167,1)\pos(320,230)}Bill Watkins (6)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:59.49,top,Class 4 mob,0,0,0,,Nice catch, Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.28,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What the heck is that monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.49,main,Becky,0,0,0,,There's no way he's our age!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.28,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,It's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.00,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Bazooka Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:12.96,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Because of his obviously \Nblessed physique and brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:16.63,main,Emile,0,0,0,,he won awards in all kinds of \Nsports tournaments in kindergarten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.33,main,Emile,0,0,0,,The Monster of Bodam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:20.76,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Are there even that many \Ntournaments in kindergarten?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:25.25,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Wearing glasses right now \Nis dangerous, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:29.26,main,Bill,0,0,0,,I humbly thank you for your concern, \NDamian, son of Chairman Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.26,0:12:32.02,main,Bill,0,0,0,,But I'll be fine, because that \Nball won't be hitting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.26,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:36.27,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Any hits above the shoulders don't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:38.86,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,Enemy positions confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.53,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,Airflow, humidity... both good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:47.95,main,Class 3 mob,0,0,0,,Gerf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:48.70,main,Class 3 mob,0,0,0,,Gah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:52.33,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Four hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:54.79,top,Class 4 mob,0,0,0,,Wow! Way to go, Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:53.41,main,Emile,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:54.79,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.91,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Don't panic! That was just a fluke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.96,0:13:00.05,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Oh, that wasn't a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.72,main,Bill,0,0,0,,When I throw the ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.68,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Every imaginable detail has been calculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:14.89,main,Bill,0,0,0,,We're not just talking simulations. \NI've trained my body to its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:34.96,flashback,Bill,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:40.34,flashback,Bill's Father,0,0,0,,Ah, my son, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:41.38,flashback,Bill,0,0,0,,Yes, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:47.18,flashback,Bill's Father,0,0,0,,You will eventually be the hero \Nof Eden, as well as our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:51.67,flashback,Bill's Father,0,0,0,,Make sure you seize those \NStellas with your own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:54.31,flashback,Bill's Father,0,0,0,,For the future of Ostania!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:56.60,flashback,Bill,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:14:00.18,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Yes... my victory is predetermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:04.32,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Um, hello?! We'll die if \Nthat actually hits us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:07.69,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll hold back on you women.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.99,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Actually, that also pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:12.17,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Gurk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:14.54,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:19.12,main,Damian,0,0,0,,That's some mouth you've got on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:22.93,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Do you really think we went into \Nthis without a plan, you giant oaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.80,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You can't win...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:28.34,main,Damian,0,0,0,,at dodgeball all by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.20,flashback,Emile,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:51.37,flashback,Emile,0,0,0,,You're gonna be the MVP! I just know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:06.01,flashback,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be the MVP!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:09.17,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Let's do this! Formation G!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:10.18,main,Emile and Ewen,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:26.77,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Four hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.90,0:15:32.28,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.08,0:15:37.87,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Ultimate...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:38.45,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,...Shadow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.45,0:15:39.29,main,Damian,0,0,0,,...Clone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:40.30,main,Damian; Emile; Ewen,0,0,0,,...Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:46.63,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Shadow clone, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:49.09,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Now, this is what you call...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.05,main,Bill,0,0,0,,a {\i1}real{\i0} shadow clone attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:56.51,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,Lord Damian...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:16:01.72,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,It was an honor to fight by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.73,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:08.61,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,I know all kinds of great \Nthings about you, Lord Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:13.23,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,Though I can't remember a single one \Nright now, I'm sure there was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:16.73,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,Please win, Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:19.98,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,Because you'll always be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:24.58,italics,Emile,0,0,0,,a true MVP in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:33.51,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,The forbidden... face block!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.89,0:16:38.52,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:41.68,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Emile! Hey! Speak to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:46.66,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Ewen... you dummy. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.36,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.40,main,Emile,0,0,0,,It's not the end yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:56.53,main,Emile,0,0,0,,So don't give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.53,0:16:59.16,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Yeah. I know. I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.75,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Once we give up, it's game over—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.87,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Damn it! At this rate, we're gonna lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.46,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I need to find his weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.17,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I don't care if the others go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:14.84,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,I need to somehow survive and stand out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.05,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Second son is a real shithead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:18.40,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.85,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,we have that little runt over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:23.02,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,I'm going to aim for... her feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:23.73,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:27.44,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey! He missed! Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:29.53,main,Out of Bounds Class 3 Student A,0,0,0,,Let's get the ball going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.03,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,She just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:33.86,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,jumped before I threw the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:36.40,main,Out of bounds class 3 student B,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.74,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.03,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,I'll aim for her right arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.03,0:17:43.70,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,Okay, her left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.79,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,I guess I'll just have to use my secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.79,0:17:53.96,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,This throw will suddenly change its course \Nand nail any opponent scampering about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:54.67,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.19,0:17:59.73,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Homing Slider Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.64,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What was that about holding back on women?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:02.89,main,Class 3 student,0,0,0,,Blorf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.01,main,Class 3 student,0,0,0,,Blorf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:06.89,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:14.11,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,That's impossible! She's \Nreading my every attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:15.99,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,Who in the world is that girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:17.86,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:18.41,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:21.23,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,"Dodgeball," of course, stems from "dodge,"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:23.41,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,meaning to swiftly move out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:27.41,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Such elegant evasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:30.63,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Anya! Look out for the guys out of bounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:35.92,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You dummy! Get up, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:41.29,italics,Bill,0,0,0,,You were impressive, but even you \Ncan't dodge from that position!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:43.02,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:46.51,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,The bastard just threw that \Nball with everything he has!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:50.02,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate... But in the end,\N this is her own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:54.61,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I shall survive \Nand lead Class 3 to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:15.71,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.18,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing, Lord Damian?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.97,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My chance at MVP!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:25.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You protected me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:25.55,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:27.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Are you a good guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:28.89,main,Damian,0,0,0,,N-N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.48,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I was just frustrated that he was \Ntaking out our team left and right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:33.65,main,Damian,0,0,0,,so I tried to catch it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.19,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:38.15,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You're the only one left. \NIt's in your hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:47.91,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The future is in Anya's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:51.46,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Now is the time to unleash my killer shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:54.79,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya, this is my final lesson for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:58.17,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,The key to throwing a ball well is to \Nput your whole body into the throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:02.01,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Think of this ball as an arrow of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.15,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I won't let your death \Ngo to waste, second son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.22,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.99,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I will avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:32.79,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,That power she had when she knocked me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:34.38,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,She might just be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:38.42,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going on, \Nbut this is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:39.84,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:57.11,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The most important thing \Nis shifting my weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:21:00.15,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,The power in my step\Nand the twisting of my hips
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:01.78,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,need to go to my widdle hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:04.41,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,And then my widdle hands... um... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:05.61,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:07.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Killer Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.32,0:21:11.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Star Catch Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:17.29,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:24.38,main,Bill,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:27.15,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:28.26,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:29.76,main,Class 4 students,0,0,0,,Yay! We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:30.81,main,Damian; Ewen; Emile,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:33.85,main,Class 4 students,0,0,0,,Now you're definitely \Ngetting that Stella, Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:35.52,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Hm? Stella?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:40.07,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,There are no Stella awarded for winning \Na mere mini-game in a single class.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:41.78,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Who in the world suggested otherwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:46.95,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,On the other hand, you had the nerve to yell \Nsomething as vile as "die" during the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:49.99,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,so I have no issue with giving \Nyou a Tonitrus Bolt instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:54.94,main,Class 4 students,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Bill! We'll just\N try harder next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:56.85,main,Class 4 students,0,0,0,,We'll have another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:58.00,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,But to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:03.13,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Two students who were at odds with each other\N worked together to take on this challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:03.13,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Too bad, Anya. But you did great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.38,0:22:08.12,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,This shows that you are worthy of \Na Stella, young ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:05.80,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.26,0:22:12.40,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, you moron! \NWhat was that crappy throw?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:13.92,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have defended you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:14.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.59,0:22:17.71,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What's your problem? \NIt's not like you hit anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:19.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya doesn't like you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:21.62,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What did you say, Stubby Legs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.62,0:22:24.84,top,Becky,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to say \Nstuff like that to girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:26.20,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Or perhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:25.94,top,Anya,0,0,0,,You really are a shithead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:27.55,top,Damian,0,0,0,,Huh?! Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.56,0:22:29.51,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Everything Mama teaches me is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.55,0:22:29.21,top,Emile and Ewen,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,271)\fscx104}"STELLA"
